{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin数"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 数”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对所有序列 $I=(i_1,\\cdots,i_k)$, 考虑 "},{"Local":{"url":"Pontryagin类","text":"Pontryagin 类"}},{"Plain":" $p_I=p_{i_1}\\cdots p_{i_k}$, Pontryagin 数可视为映射\n$$\r\np_I\\colon \\Omega \\to\\mathbb Z,\r\n[M]\\mapsto \\left&lt;p_I(M),[M]\\right&gt;,\r\n$$\n因为它是"},{"Local":{"url":"配边","text":"配边"}},{"Plain":"不变量.</p>\n"}]}}